  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Colored-Water/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Colored-Water?style=flat-square&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcolored-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/colored-water/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p><h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hEzgIwf.png\" alt=\"\"></h2><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>关于</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在寻找一个简单的装饰模组吗？这个模组添加了彩色水，你可以用它随心所欲地装饰你的世界。模组还加入了浓缩彩色水。这两种水都有发光变体！还有炼药锅！！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>与Optifine不兼容，但可与Rubidium配合使用！（说实话，目前我不太确定，某些版本能正常工作，而另一些版本似乎不行。）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6IzYmBQ.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrVcZRn.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>现在你可以将彩色水倒入炼药锅了！</em></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3PAo8LX.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合成方式直观且简单。你只需要收集一桶水和一种染料。浓缩水需要额外添加一种染料，而发光版本则需要荧石粉！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6HY17M.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
